flowchart TD
    Start([Student receives assignment link or scans QR]) --> OpenURL[Open /submit/:assignmentId]
    OpenURL --> FetchContext[Fetch Assignment Guidelines, Questions & Deadline]
    FetchContext --> CheckDeadline{Is current time > due date?}
    CheckDeadline -- Yes --> SubClosed[Display Submissions Closed Alert]
    SubClosed --> End([Workflow Terminated])
    CheckDeadline -- No --> AuthWall{Signed in with Google?}
    AuthWall -- No --> ClickGoogle[Click 'Sign in with Google']
    ClickGoogle --> SupaOAuth[Supabase Google OAuth Redirection]
    SupaOAuth --> ReturnPortal[Return to Portal with Verified Google Session]
    ReturnPortal --> AuthWall
    AuthWall -- Yes --> DisplayForm[Display Student Submission Form]

    DisplayForm --> FillMeta[Enter Full Name & Roll Number]
    FillMeta --> SelectFile[Select or Drag & Drop File]
    SelectFile --> ValidateFormat{Is file .pdf or .docx?}
    ValidateFormat -- No --> FormatErr[Show Invalid File Format Error]
    FormatErr --> SelectFile
    ValidateFormat -- Yes --> ValidateSize{Is file <= 10MB?}
    ValidateSize -- No --> SizeErr[Show File Exceeds 10MB Error]
    SizeErr --> SelectFile
    ValidateSize -- Yes --> ReadySubmit[File Attached Successfully]

    ReadySubmit --> ClickSubmit[Click 'Submit Assignment Now →']
    ClickSubmit --> ServerIngest[Server Ingests Buffer in RAM]
    ServerIngest --> CloudStore[Upload Document to Supabase Storage]
    CloudStore --> CheckOverwrite{Prior submission with same email?}
    CheckOverwrite -- Yes --> DeleteOld[Delete Prior File from Storage Bucket]
    DeleteOld --> ExtractText[Dual-Engine Text Extraction]
    CheckOverwrite -- No --> ExtractText
    
    ExtractText --> CheckLength{Cleaned text >= 100 chars?}
    CheckLength -- Yes --> CallAI[Invoke Azure OpenAI gpt-5-mini & Sapling AI]
    CheckLength -- No --> SkipAI[Mark Content as Short / Non-Extractable]
    CallAI --> SaveDB[Insert or Update Record in submissions Table]
    SkipAI --> SaveDB
    SaveDB --> ShowReceipt[Render Submission Receipt & Confirmation]
    ShowReceipt --> Done([Submission Complete])
